---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../site.config';

const personId = `${siteConfig.url}/#person`;
const websiteId = `${siteConfig.url}/#website`;
const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@graph': [
    {
      '@type': 'WebSite',
      '@id': websiteId,
      name: siteConfig.title,
      alternateName: siteConfig.titleEn,
      url: siteConfig.url,
      description: siteConfig.description,
      inLanguage: ['zh-CN', 'en'],
      author: { '@id': personId },
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Person',
      '@id': personId,
      name: siteConfig.author,
      alternateName: siteConfig.romanizedName,
      url: `${siteConfig.url}/about/`,
      email: `mailto:${siteConfig.social.email}`,
      homeLocation: { '@type': 'Place', name: siteConfig.profile.locationEn },
      description: '一名在校学生，目前在杭州；喜欢有想象力的项目，也坚定支持开源。',
      sameAs: [siteConfig.social.github, siteConfig.social.bilibili],
    },
  ],
};
---
<BaseLayout jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <div data-pagefind-body>
    <section class="profile-hero">
      <div class="container profile-hero-card">
        <span class="hero-spark hero-spark-one" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
        <span class="hero-spark hero-spark-two" aria-hidden="true">♡</span>
        <div class="profile-hero-grid">
          <div class="profile-hero-copy">
            <span class="hello-pill"><span aria-hidden="true">ฅ</span> 欢迎来到我的小角落</span>
            <div class="profile-name-wrap">
              <h1 data-pagefind-meta="title">{siteConfig.title}</h1>
              <p class="profile-name-en" lang="en">{siteConfig.titleEn}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="profile-motto">
              <p>{siteConfig.tagline}</p>
              <span lang="en">{siteConfig.taglineEn}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="profile-lead">
              <p>你好呀，我是徐丰俊，目前是一名在校学生，人在杭州。我喜欢有想象力的小项目，也一直坚定支持开源——很喜欢开源世界里分享与合作的感觉。这里是我的小小落脚点，放着一点关于我的碎片和公开联系方式。欢迎随便逛逛，喵～</p>
              <p lang="en">Hi, I’m 徐丰俊 (Xu Fengjun in pinyin), a student currently in Hangzhou. I enjoy imaginative projects and strongly support open source, especially its spirit of sharing and collaboration. This is my small corner of the web, with a few notes about me and ways to say hello.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button button-primary" href="/about/">来认识一下 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
              <a class="button" href="#contact">留下一枚爪印 <span aria-hidden="true">♡</span></a>
            </div>
            <ul class="hero-chips" role="list" aria-label="个人标签">
              <li>杭州</li>
              <li>在校学生</li>
              <li>开源爱好者</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <aside class="hero-note profile-card" aria-label="可爱的个人名片">
            <span class="note-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <div class="hero-note-top"><span lang="en">TODAY'S LITTLE NOTE</span><span aria-hidden="true">♡</span></div>
            <div class="cat-portrait" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 280 250" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path class="cat-tail" d="M205 184c43-4 50 35 22 42-21 5-28-13-17-24" />
                <ellipse class="cat-body" cx="144" cy="190" rx="65" ry="48" />
                <path class="cat-head" d="M82 79 99 38l34 24c8-2 17-2 25 0l34-24 14 45c11 13 16 30 12 49-7 36-39 55-77 53-40-2-72-25-73-62-1-17 4-32 14-44Z" />
                <path class="cat-ear" d="m101 68 5-17 16 12M184 67l-3-17-15 12" />
                <ellipse class="cat-cheek" cx="105" cy="125" rx="18" ry="11" />
                <ellipse class="cat-cheek" cx="182" cy="125" rx="18" ry="11" />
                <path class="cat-face" d="M116 108h1M170 108h1M139 121c4 4 8 4 12 0M145 121v9m0 0c-6 0-10 3-12 7m12-7c6 0 10 3 12 7M99 122l-24-4m25 13-25 5m114-14 24-4m-24 13 25 5" />
                <path class="cat-paws" d="M112 211c7-11 18-12 27-2m10 0c10-10 21-8 27 3" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="cat-speech">今天也要开心呀～</div>
            <div class="hero-note-bottom">
              <p>{siteConfig.profile.role}<br /><span lang="en">{siteConfig.profile.roleEn}</span></p>
              <span class="profile-location">{siteConfig.profile.location}<small lang="en">{siteConfig.profile.locationEn}</small></span>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section values-section" aria-labelledby="values-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow" lang="en">LITTLE THINGS I LIKE</span>
            <h2 id="values-title">口袋里装着这些。</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="section-sidecopy">三枚关于我的小标签</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-grid">
          <article class="value-card value-card-pink">
            <span class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><small>灵感收集罐</small>
            <h3>有趣的脑洞</h3><p>喜欢那些有点奇怪、又可能慢慢长成惊喜的小项目。</p>
            <hr /><h4 lang="en">Imagination</h4><p lang="en">A soft spot for ideas that might grow into something delightful.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="value-card value-card-mint">
            <span class="value-icon value-code" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/&gt;</span><small>一起搭建吧</small>
            <h3>开源与分享</h3><p>喜欢可以被阅读、被分享，也能被大家一起变得更好的东西。</p>
            <hr /><h4 lang="en">Open source</h4><p lang="en">Good things become better when we build them together.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="value-card value-card-lavender">
            <span class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><small>校园日常中</small>
            <h3>学生进行时</h3><p>目前是一名在校学生，人在杭州。</p>
            <hr /><h4 lang="en">Student life</h4><p lang="en">Currently a student, based in Hangzhou.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section now-section">
      <div class="container now-panel profile-now">
        <span class="now-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div>
          <span class="language-label"><span lang="en">RIGHT MEOW</span> / 此刻</span>
          <h2>{siteConfig.now}</h2>
          <p lang="en">{siteConfig.nowEn}</p>
        </div>
        <span class="now-place">待续<small lang="en">More soon</small></span>
        <span class="now-tail" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section contact-section" id="contact">
      <div class="container contact-panel">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow" lang="en">LEAVE A PAWPRINT</span>
          <h2>想来敲敲门吗？</h2>
          <p>目前我不求职，也不接单。不过如果你也喜欢有趣的点子，或者只是想说声你好，都可以从下面找到我。</p>
          <p lang="en">I’m not looking for work or taking commissions, but you’re always welcome to say hello through the public channels below.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-links">
          <a class="contact-link contact-link-primary" href={`mailto:${siteConfig.social.email}`}>
            <span lang="en">EMAIL</span><strong>{siteConfig.social.email}</strong><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i>
          </a>
          <a class="contact-link" href={siteConfig.social.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            <span lang="en">GITHUB</span><strong>@ansujuner</strong><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i><span class="sr-only">（新窗口打开）</span>
          </a>
          <a class="contact-link" href={siteConfig.social.bilibili} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            <span lang="en">BILIBILI</span><strong>{siteConfig.social.bilibiliName}</strong><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i><span class="sr-only">（新窗口打开）</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
